Thu Sep 10 18:28:23 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to version 2026.9.10.84818:
  * Save attachments byte-exact: JSON-content attachments no longer
    fail redmine_download with TypeError (request gains a raw flag)

